  "request": {
    "spec": "Replace the string membership tier with a numeric 'membershipLevel' from 1 to 3 on creation: start at 1; add 1 when an email is present; add 1 when namesakeCount is 0; cap at 3 (level 4 is reserved for tenure). Remove the 'membershipTier' field from the response in favour of 'membershipLevel'. This changes the existing tier behaviour, and anything that recorded the tier (such as the create audit line) must record the level instead.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nReplace the string membership tier with a numeric 'membershipLevel' from 1 to 3 on creation: start at 1; add 1 when an email is present; add 1 when namesakeCount is 0; cap at 3 (level 4 is reserved for tenure). Remove the 'membershipTier' field from the response in favour of 'membershipLevel'. This changes the existing tier behaviour, and anything that recorded the tier (such as the create audit line) must record the level instead.\n"
  },
